OL,3,GNEWSA'I couldn't move, walk or talk
OL,4,Aafter my stroke'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I was so frightened and had no idea
OL,7,Fwhat my life would be like. I couldn't
OL,8,Fmove, walk or even talk ` I felt so
OL,9,Falone," she said.
